  "article":{
    "html":"<article><p>The warmer runs from the same queue as everything else, which is why it is bounded by the same concurrency limit and why a cold start is slower than the numbers suggest.</p><p>Each entry is fetched once and shared, so a burst of readers for the same key costs one fetch rather than one per reader.</p></article>",
